LAST_SUCCESS=Task 97 bug#5 (earpiece/speaker toggle, [2] pin -889) ROOT-CAUSED + FIXED + device-verified. Cause: call output's per-stream deviceIds pin → AAudio opens a 2nd MMAP direct output, but taimen mmap_no_irq_out maxOpenCount=1 → earpiece pin -889s when another output holds the slot; speaker [3] only worked by reusing existing MMAP output. FIX: call output no longer pins deviceId (audio_routing.rs Route::Call → device_ids=[], shares MMAP, never -889); route via PREFERRED device-role on MEDIA strategy — audio_policy_impl::set_media_strategy_route(speaker)→setDevicesRoleForStrategy(getProductStrategyFromAudioAttributes(MEDIA),PREFERRED,[OUT_SPEAKER|OUT_SPEAKER_EARPIECE]), applied from set_comms_route (re-routes EXISTING shared output → mid-call toggle works, no re-open) + at call-track open; cleared on call-end (CommMode comm:false→clear_comms_route). Verified: --probe-route-toggle (getDevicesForAttributes MEDIA followed 140→141→140→default, no -889); --probe-call-stall 3 0 0 1 earpiece now opens (was -889).
